id: pmc-milestone-status-roles
title: Use configured done status roles for immutable milestone generation
description: "During release-correction validation, configured terminal_done statuses were accepted by the SDK-backed correction view, while resolveTrackerReleaseHistory in src/milestones.ts still selects frozen rows by the literal closed status. A custom done-role capture can therefore disappear from historical generation. Existing rendering behavior is outside the append-only correction scope."
